{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Good Dog Club. Bark fast and bark strong. Rocket jump your way through increasingly difficult levels and don't let anything slow you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Indomitable Rocket Dog is a fast paced, physics-based, 2D platformer time-trial game. Use your rockets to propel yourself through each area as fast as you can and earn a perfect rank on each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like N++, Neon White, &amp; Sonic, you'll have to master your physics and momentum to get perfect times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a full level editor &amp; leaderboards with the ability to watch world-record runs. It is currently under development and will hopefully release in 2026!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433820?t=1765317600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765317600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433820/b93c646c6b15d94746ef89bd20035e9ae6c145ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765317600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433820/b93c646c6b15d94746ef89bd20035e9ae6c145ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765317600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Good Dog Club. Bark fast and bark strong. Rocket jump your way through increasingly difficult levels and don't let anything slow you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Indomitable Rocket Dog is a fast paced, physics-based, 2D platformer time-trial game. Use your rockets to propel yourself through each area as fast as you can and earn a perfect rank on each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like N++, Neon White, &amp; Sonic, you'll have to master your physics and momentum to get perfect times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a full level editor &amp; leaderboards with the ability to watch world-record runs. It is currently under development and will hopefully release in 2026!</p>","developers":["AndyMakes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433820/4138047dad0d7c48fc1e1b959a2d9d39a8ea3b25/header.jpg?t=1765317600","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"name":"The Indomitable Rocket Dog","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["AndyMakes"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433820/db3832ea0942cfe3a6cd36d160ef6bc0e156ffef/ss_db3832ea0942cfe3a6cd36d160ef6bc0e156ffef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765317600","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433820/db3832ea0942cfe3a6cd36d160ef6bc0e156ffef/ss_db3832ea0942cfe3a6cd36d160ef6bc0e156ffef